---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Kitchen, Bathroom & Home Remodeling
description: J-Dub Remodeling LLC handles kitchen, bathroom, and general home remodeling. Talk with Justin Robson about your project and get a free quote.
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">{{ site.tagline }}</p>
      <h1>Your Home. Your Vision. Let’s Build It.</h1>
      <p class="lede">J-Dub Remodeling LLC takes on kitchen, bathroom, and general home remodeling. Tell Justin what you have in mind, and he’ll talk it through with you and put together a free quote.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/contact/#quote">Request a Free Quote</a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg" href="tel:{{ site.contact.phoneE164 }}" data-track="phone">Call Justin</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-phone">Or text <a href="sms:{{ site.contact.phoneE164 }}" data-track="text">{{ site.contact.phoneDisplay }}</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-logo">
      <picture>
        <source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/img/logo-720.webp 720w, /assets/img/logo-1080.webp 1080w" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 520px, 90vw">
        <img src="/assets/img/logo-720.jpg" srcset="/assets/img/logo-720.jpg 720w, /assets/img/logo-1080.jpg 1080w" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 520px, 90vw" width="720" height="181" alt="J-Dub Remodeling LLC. Kitchens, bathrooms, and more." fetchpriority="high">
      </picture>
      <p class="hero-logo-tag">{{ site.taglineServices }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="services-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-dark">What we do</p>
      <h2 id="services-heading">Kitchens, bathrooms, and more</h2>
      <p>From a full room overhaul to a handful of focused updates, every project starts with a conversation about how you use your home.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <a class="service-card" href="/services/#kitchens">
        <h3>Kitchen Remodeling</h3>
        <p>Rework a kitchen that no longer fits the way you cook, gather, and store things.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Learn more</span>
      </a>
      <a class="service-card" href="/services/#bathrooms">
        <h3>Bathroom Remodeling</h3>
        <p>Turn a dated or hard-to-use bathroom into one that works better every day.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Learn more</span>
      </a>
      <a class="service-card" href="/services/#general">
        <h3>General Remodeling</h3>
        <p>Other rooms and projects around the house. If it’s on your list, ask about it.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Learn more</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{%- if gallery.length %}
<section class="section section-alt" aria-labelledby="projects-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-dark">Recent work</p>
      <h2 id="projects-heading">Before and after</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="project-grid">
      {%- asyncEach project in gallery | featured(3) %}
      {% include "partials/project-card.njk" %}
      {%- endeach %}
    </div>
    <p class="section-more"><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/projects/">See all projects</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
{%- include "partials/lightbox.njk" %}
{%- endif %}

<section class="section{% if not gallery.length %} section-alt{% endif %}" aria-labelledby="process-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-dark">Getting started</p>
      <h2 id="process-heading">How a project gets going</h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li>
        <h3>Reach out</h3>
        <p>Call, text, or send the quote form with a short description of what you want done.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Talk it through</h3>
        <p>Justin will follow up to learn more about the space, what you’re hoping for, and your timing.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Get your free quote</h3>
        <p>You’ll get a quote for the work you discussed, so you can decide on your next step.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="container split">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-dark">Who you’ll work with</p>
      <h2 id="about-heading">Talk directly with Justin</h2>
      <p>When you contact J-Dub Remodeling LLC, you’re talking with {{ site.contact.person }}. Bring your ideas, your questions, and the parts of your home that need attention.</p>
      <p><a class="text-link" href="/about/">About J-Dub Remodeling</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-card">
      <p class="contact-card-name">{{ site.contact.person }}</p>
      <ul class="contact-list">
        <li><a href="tel:{{ site.contact.phoneE164 }}" data-track="phone">Call {{ site.contact.phoneDisplay }}</a></li>
        <li><a href="sms:{{ site.contact.phoneE164 }}" data-track="text">Text {{ site.contact.phoneDisplay }}</a></li>
        <li><a href="mailto:{{ site.contact.email }}" data-track="email">{{ site.contact.email }}</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/cta-band.njk" %}
